01:15:13.300 --> 01:15:18.280
I don't know what you're up to, but there's no reason for you to defeat the next nobleman.

01:15:18.800 --> 01:15:23.330
I'll take care of this with a different way of thinking than before.

01:15:30.028 --> 01:15:36.528
I don't know if I've ruined your family, but I'll kill you for what you've done to me.

01:15:36.588 --> 01:15:39.588
Use that sword to take your own life!

01:15:41.164 --> 01:15:43.164
Thank you for watching!

01:15:46.348 --> 01:15:46.948
Who are you?

01:16:48.560 --> 01:16:49.140
What are you doing?

01:16:49.320 --> 01:16:50.410
Hurry up and avenge your father!

01:16:51.290 --> 01:16:56.260
I will destroy you!

01:16:57.630 --> 01:16:57.730
What?

01:16:57.910 --> 01:16:59.840
You are his daughter!

01:17:00.030 --> 01:17:02.560
Ever since I forgot the pride of a nobleman!

01:17:02.640 --> 01:17:05.800
I don't get it!

01:17:05.820 --> 01:17:29.380
Could it be that you are a priest?!

01:17:47.370 --> 01:17:52.890
I am a noble. If you say that the gods will perish, it is only natural that you obey it.

01:17:53.650 --> 01:17:59.950
I am just like you, Dan Peel. You have no human blood.

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:03.040
The blood will flow, and even if you take off the clothes of a noble, you can still live.

01:18:04.170 --> 01:18:06.600
I am a pure noble!

01:18:06.960 --> 01:18:09.000
The blood of the Degesens...

01:20:00.540 --> 01:20:00.800
Thank you.

01:21:00.190 --> 01:21:04.600
Ha, ha, ha.

01:24:01.050 --> 01:24:07.550
She's a good machine.
